Data provenance
---------------
PRISM-VLM recycles items from the fifteen public benchmarks below. This
repository redistributes no benchmark images, questions or gold answers.
`prism-vlm build` and `prism-vlm run` fetch fourteen of them from the
HuggingFace Hub at run time, on the user's own machine. NLVR2 is not fetched:
its authors give the images only to researchers who request them, so the user
obtains it from them directly (see README -> NLVR2).

Before the first download, `build` and `run` print the terms below and ask the
user to accept them (`--accept-dataset-terms` accepts them non-interactively).

