Some Hub copies above were uploaded by third parties and show a license that
differs from the original authors' terms. The original authors' terms apply.

Two ids are historical. TallyQA is not available on the Hub and its slot is
filled by BLINK Counting; MMT-Bench's slot is filled by NLVR2. The ids are
hashed into every item id, so they cannot be renamed without invalidating the
pool.

